{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301292","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301292","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430129201:1":{"text":"공방을 열고 최고의 대장장이가 될 거야. 드워프라면 당연히 장인이 되어야지!","source_cn":"我打算开一家工坊，然后成为工坊里的锻造大师，矮人就应该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DD9E2BAECAF49B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430129202:1":{"text":"공방을 열 돈을 모으려고 지금 광산에서 고생하고 있는 거니까.","source_cn":"我一直在矿洞里挖矿，就是为了攒够开工坊所需要的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2423754BFECDD38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矿工奥多":{"text":"광부 오드","source":"矿工奥多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}